Painter/Painter.h: Painter/Painter.h defines U++’s vector graphics painting API, including coordinate transforms, path and shape drawing, fills, strokes, gradients, text, images, clipping, and SVG rendering through Painter and related backends.
Painter/Painting.h: Painter/Painting.h defines U++’s `Painting` vector-graphics command representation: path, fill, stroke, clipping, transforms, text, image, and opacity operations, plus the `PaintingPainter` interface.
Painter/LinearPath.h: Painter/LinearPath.h defines path-processing primitives for Painter: curve approximation and linear-path filters, including stroking, dashing, transformation, and rasterization.
Painter/AlphaBlend.h: Painter/AlphaBlend.h provides alpha-blending primitives and helpers, including scalar and SIMD routines for blending pixels and vectors, broadcasting alpha values, and constructing alpha channels.
Painter/Fillers.h: Painter/Fillers.h provides internal scanline filler classes used by the Painter rasterizer, including solid, span, subpixel, clipping, mask, and anti-aliasing filter implementations.
Painter/BufferPainter.h: Painter/BufferPainter.h declares the buffer-based raster painting engine and its path, clipping, gradient, image, and text rendering machinery. It defines painter targets, span sources, drawing jobs, and supporting geometry and color data.
Painter/SvgInternal.h: Internal SVG-rendering support: `BoundsPainter` tracks path, text, and transformed geometry bounds, while `SvgParser` parses SVG/XML elements, styles, gradients, transforms, paths, IDs, and resources for a `Painter`.
